sequenceDiagram
    participant SPOC as Activity SPOC
    participant UI as E4H Web UI (Extended)
    participant GW as E4H API Gateway (Existing)
    participant AUTH as E4H Auth Service (Existing)
    participant AMS as Activity Management Service (NEW)
    participant FPS as Field Planner Service (NEW)
    participant HFR as Health Facility Registry (Existing)
    participant HRMS as eGov HRMS (Existing)
    participant EGOV_FS as eGov Filestore (Existing)
    participant WF as eGov Workflow v2 (Existing)
    participant DB as E4H PostgreSQL (Shared)
    participant MOBILE as Mobile App
    participant FS as Field Staff
    
    Note over SPOC,FS: E4H Integrated Health Facility Assignment by Activity SPOC
    
    SPOC->>UI: Login and view assignment dashboard (E4H)
    UI->>GW: GET /user/oauth/me
    GW->>AUTH: Validate SPOC JWT token
    AUTH->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
    Note over AUTH,HRMS: Validate SPOC employee with activity roles
    HRMS-->>AUTH: SPOC validated with activity permissions
    AUTH-->>GW: User authenticated as Activity SPOC
    GW-->>UI: User authenticated
    
    UI->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/activity-assignments/_search?assignedToMe=true&status=active
    GW->>AMS: Fetch active assignments for SPOC (new service)
    AMS->>DB: Query activity_assignments table with facility counts (new table)
    DB-->>AMS: Return assignments with statistics
    AMS-->>GW: Return assignment data
    GW-->>UI: Display assignment dashboard
    UI-->>SPOC: Show assigned field plans and progress
    
    SPOC->>UI: Click on specific field plan assignment
    UI->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/facility-activities/_search?fieldPlanId={id}&activityId={activityId}&assignedToMe=true
    GW->>AMS: Get facilities for activity assignment (new service)
    AMS->>DB: Query facility_activities table for field plan and activity (new table)
    DB-->>AMS: Return facility list with assignment status
    
    AMS->>HFR: GET /facility/v1/_search
    Note over AMS,HFR: Get facility details from existing registry
    HFR-->>AMS: Facility details (name, location, type, status)
    
    AMS-->>GW: Return facilities with integrated data
    GW-->>UI: Display facility assignment interface
    UI-->>SPOC: Show facilities with assignment status
    
    Note over SPOC,UI: SPOC sees unassigned facilities that need team assignment
    
    SPOC->>UI: Check team members availability
    UI->>GW: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search?supervisorId={spocId}&designation=FIELD_STAFF
    GW->>HRMS: Get team members for activity (existing service)
    HRMS->>DB: Query eg_hrms_employee table for employees under SPOC with required skills
    DB-->>HRMS: Return team member list
    HRMS-->>GW: Return team data
    GW-->>UI: Display team members
    UI-->>SPOC: Show available field staff
    
    alt No Team Members Available
        SPOC->>UI: Click "Add Team Members"
        UI->>GW: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search?employeeType=FIELD_STAFF&tenantId={tenantId}
        GW->>HRMS: Search for field staff employees (existing service)
        HRMS->>DB: Query eg_hrms_employee table for available field staff
        DB-->>HRMS: Return potential team members
        HRMS-->>GW: Return employee list
        GW-->>UI: Display available staff
        
        SPOC->>UI: Select staff members to add to team
        UI->>GW: POST /field-planner/v1/teams/add-members
        GW->>AMS: Add members to SPOC's team (new service)
        AMS->>HRMS: POST /egov-hrms/employees/_update
        Note over AMS,HRMS: Update employee assignments to link with SPOC
        HRMS->>DB: Create/update eg_hrms_assignment records
        DB-->>HRMS: Team associations updated
        HRMS-->>AMS: Employee assignments updated
        
        Note over AMS: E4H notification system handles team invitations
        AMS->>AMS: Publish TeamAssignmentEvent via Kafka
        
        AMS-->>GW: Team members added
        GW-->>UI: Show success message
        UI-->>SPOC: "Team members added successfully"
    end
    
    SPOC->>UI: Assign facilities to field staff
    Note over SPOC,UI: Can assign individual or bulk assign
    
    alt Individual Assignment
        SPOC->>UI: Select facility and field staff member
        UI->>GW: POST /field-planner/v1/facility-activities/{id}/assign-user
        GW->>AMS: Assign facility to field staff (new service)
        
        AMS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
        Note over AMS,HRMS: Validate field staff employee exists and is active
        HRMS-->>AMS: Field staff validated
        
        AMS->>DB: Check if facility can be assigned (facility_activities table)
        alt Facility Already Assigned
            DB-->>AMS: Return assignment conflict
            AMS-->>GW: Return error
            GW-->>UI: Show error message
            UI-->>SPOC: "Facility already assigned to another user"
        else Assignment Valid
            AMS->>DB: Update facility_activities record (new table)
            AMS->>DB: Set assigned_user and status
            DB-->>AMS: Assignment completed
            
            AMS->>AMS: Check activation conditions
            Note over AMS: Evaluate if facility should be activated
            
            alt Conditions Met for Activation
                AMS->>DB: Update status to ACTIVE
                AMS->>DB: Set activated_at timestamp
                DB-->>AMS: Status updated to ACTIVE
                
                Note over AMS: Send activation notification via Kafka
                AMS->>AMS: Publish FacilityActivationEvent
                Note over MOBILE: E4H notification consumers send push to mobile
                MOBILE-->>FS: Show "New facility activated"
                
            else Conditions Not Met
                Note over AMS: Status remains SCHEDULED
                Note over AMS: Send assignment notification via Kafka
                AMS->>AMS: Publish FacilityAssignmentEvent
                Note over MOBILE: E4H notification system handles delivery
                MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Facility assigned, waiting for activation"
            end
            
            AMS-->>GW: Assignment successful
            GW-->>UI: Return success response
            UI-->>SPOC: Show assignment confirmation
        end
        
    else Bulk Assignment via Excel
        SPOC->>UI: Click "Bulk Assign Facilities"
        UI->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/facility-activities/assignment-template?fieldPlanId={id}
        GW->>AMS: Generate assignment template (new service)
        AMS->>DB: Get facilities and team members from new tables
        DB-->>AMS: Return data for template
        
        AMS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
        Note over AMS,HRMS: Get team members for dropdown
        HRMS-->>AMS: Team member data
        
        AMS->>EGOV_FS: POST /filestore/v1/files (generate template)
        EGOV_FS->>EGOV_FS: Generate Excel with dropdowns
        EGOV_FS-->>AMS: Return template UUID and URL
        AMS-->>GW: Return template download link
        GW-->>UI: Download template from eGov Filestore
        UI-->>SPOC: Template downloaded
        
        SPOC->>SPOC: Fill assignment data in Excel
        SPOC->>UI: Upload completed assignment file
        
        UI->>GW: POST /field-planner/v1/facility-activities/bulk-assign (multipart)
        GW->>AMS: Process bulk assignment (new service)
        AMS->>EGOV_FS: POST /filestore/v1/files (validate uploaded file)
        EGOV_FS->>EGOV_FS: Validate uploaded file format
        
        alt Invalid File Format
            EGOV_FS-->>AMS: Return format error
            AMS-->>GW: Return validation error
            GW-->>UI: Show error message
            UI-->>SPOC: "Invalid file format"
        else Valid File
            EGOV_FS->>EGOV_FS: Parse assignment data
            EGOV_FS-->>AMS: Return assignment list
            
            AMS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
            Note over AMS,HRMS: Validate all assigned employees exist and are active
            HRMS-->>AMS: Employee validation results
            
            AMS->>DB: Begin transaction
            
            loop For each facility assignment
                AMS->>DB: Validate assignment (no conflicts, facility_activities table)
                alt Assignment Conflict
                    DB-->>AMS: Return conflict error
                    AMS->>AMS: Add to error list
                else Valid Assignment
                    AMS->>DB: Update facility_activities record (new table)
                    DB-->>AMS: Assignment updated
                    
                    AMS->>AMS: Check activation conditions
                    alt Conditions Met
                        AMS->>DB: Set status to ACTIVE
                        AMS->>DB: Set activated_at timestamp
                        DB-->>AMS: Status activated
                    else Conditions Not Met
                        Note over AMS: Remains SCHEDULED
                    end
                end
            end
            
            alt Assignment Errors Found
                AMS->>DB: Rollback transaction
                AMS->>EGOV_FS: POST /filestore/v1/files (generate error report)
                EGOV_FS-->>AMS: Return error report UUID and URL
                AMS-->>GW: Return bulk assignment errors
                GW-->>UI: Show error summary with download link
                UI-->>SPOC: "Some assignments failed, download error report"
                
            else All Assignments Successful
                AMS->>DB: Commit transaction
                DB-->>AMS: All assignments committed
                
                Note over AMS: E4H audit patterns handle bulk assignment logging
                
                Note over AMS: Send notifications via E4H Kafka events
                loop For each assigned field staff
                    AMS->>AMS: Publish FacilityAssignmentEvent
                    Note over MOBILE: E4H notification consumers handle mobile push
                    MOBILE-->>FS: Show facility assignment notification
                end
                
                AMS-->>GW: Bulk assignment successful
                GW-->>UI: Return success summary
                UI-->>SPOC: Show "X facilities assigned successfully"
            end
        end
    end
    
    Note over SPOC,FS: Field Staff receives E4H notifications
    
    FS->>MOBILE: Open mobile app
    MOBILE->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/facility-activities/_search?assignedToMe=true&status=active
    GW->>AMS: Get active facilities for field staff (new service)
    AMS->>DB: Query facility_activities table for active assignments (new table)
    DB-->>AMS: Return active facility activities
    
    AMS->>HFR: GET /facility/v1/_search
    Note over AMS,HFR: Get facility details from existing registry
    HFR-->>AMS: Facility details for mobile display
    
    AMS-->>GW: Return facility list with integrated data
    GW-->>MOBILE: Display assigned facilities
    MOBILE-->>FS: Show active facilities ready for work
    
    SPOC->>UI: Monitor assignment progress
    UI->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/field-plans/{id}/progress?activityId={activityId}
    GW->>AMS: Get assignment and progress statistics (new service)
    AMS->>DB: Query facility_activities table for status counts (new table)
    DB-->>AMS: Return progress data
    AMS-->>GW: Return progress statistics
    GW-->>UI: Display progress dashboard
    UI-->>SPOC: Show assignment progress (Assigned: X, Active: Y, Completed: Z)
    
    Note over SPOC,FS: E4H Platform Integration Complete
    Note over SPOC,FS: Facilities assigned via Activity Management Service
    Note over SPOC,FS: Team management via eGov HRMS integration
    Note over SPOC,FS: Field staff can begin work with mobile app sync
    Note over SPOC,FS: All data stored in shared E4H PostgreSQL database 